Task 2: Movie Ticket Booking System Using Sorting
Scenario
A movie booking company wants to display movies sorted by ticket price and movie name so
customers can easily find suitable movies.
Requirements
Entity: Movie
Variables
• movieId
• movieName
• language
• ticketPrice
Classes
• Movie
• MovieRepository
• MovieService
• MovieServiceImpl
• AppConfig
• MainClass
Instructions
1. Create Movie entity.
2. Create MovieRepository extending PagingAndSortingRepository.
3. Insert minimum 10 movie records.
4. Implement sorting using Spring Data JPA.
5. Sort records:
• Movie Name Ascending
• Movie Name Descending
• Ticket Price Ascending
• Ticket Price Descending
Expected Operations
• Sort movies by name.
• Sort movies by ticket price